            "config": {
              "text": "The first DM waits for a tap before checking follow status. That interaction opens the normal DM window, so protected content is not sent as a second message from the one-time comment private reply. FOLLOWING unlocks the content, NOT_FOLLOWING asks them to follow and retry, and UNKNOWN asks again instead of pretending they are not following.\n\nBefore you publish: swap every example.com link for your own, rename the tags to match yours, and rewrite the copy in your voice."
